      "content": "thanks but it doesn't really feel real. like i see my reflection or whatever but it feels like a glitch. everyone moved on and left me in this vacuum. it's like i'm a ghost that's just haunting my own life. does that even make sense? just being a shadow of someone who used to matter.",
