    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. it just feels like being a ghost is the only way to deal with it. like, if i'm already invisible to everyone and everything feels fake, then what's even the point of trying to be \"real\" anymore? it feels like i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up to the fact that i'm already gone.",
